Requirements
• 4+ years of experience in B2B sales, consulting, or business development, ideally in the ERP, SaaS, or professional services sectors.

• Existing network within the Oracle Cloud or Oracle partner ecosystem (sales, alliances, or consulting channels).

• Prior experience engaging with Oracle account teams or positioning complementary solutions to Oracle ERP, PPM, or Fusion Cloud customers.

• Familiarity with Oracle Cloud (especially Oracle PPM Cloud) or similar enterprise software platforms is a strong advantage.

• Proven track record of developing leads, closing enterprise deals, and building client relationships.

• Exceptional communication and presentation skills; ability to engage both technical and business stakeholders.

• Strategic thinker with a hands-on, entrepreneurial mindset.

• Ability to work independently and thrive in a fast-paced, growing business.

• Willingness to travel for client meetings and industry events.

Nice to Have
• Experience selling into Oracle-based environments (e.g. Oracle Cloud ERP, HCM, SCM) or working closely with Oracle consulting or alliance teams

About the Company

Projects Expert is a fast-growing consultancy and SaaS provider specialising in Oracle Project Portfolio Management (PPM) Cloud. Our mission is to help enterprises achieve strategic alignment, streamline project governance, and unlock greater value from their Oracle ERP investments. Our proprietary SaaS platform enhances Oracle’s native capabilities with advanced planning, capital governance, and AI-driven portfolio insights. We serve clients across Europe and North America, including global leaders in the life sciences and financial services sectors

Apply Now

Oracle Apex Developer (Remote)

Apply Now
Remote

Job Type

Full Time

Workspace

Hybrid

About the Role

At Projects Expert, we are currently looking to hire an experienced APEX developer, who has proven experience in developing and designing bespoke solutions using Oracle APEX Web-based application toolset..

