• Expert in Angular versions 12 and above

• Expert understanding of Java fundamentals, versions 12 and below

• Expert understanding of Java servlets and filters

• Expert understanding of RESTful web services/APIs

• Expert understanding of popular Object Relational Mapping frameworks, especially JPA/Hibernate and Entity Framework

• Proficient understanding of SOAP web services

• Proficient in CICD methodologies and automated deployment pipelines

• Proficient understanding of designing and implementing relational databases, especially Oracle versions 18 and below

• knowledge of Oracle PL/SQL

• Expert understanding of Spring MVC, especially Rest Controllers

• Proficient understanding of Spring IoC

• Proficient understanding of Scrum/Agile projects

• Proficient in Jira

• Proficient in Git and GitHub

• Proficient in Maven

• Proficient in usage of Eclipse and/or other IDE

• Proficient with Jenkins continuous integration

How to Apply

Interested in joining our team?

Please send your resume and cover letter to info@sannik.co.uk, indicating the position you're applying for in the subject line. We look forward to hearing from you!

UI Designer

3 The Quadrant, Coventry, UK

Job Type

Full Time

Workspace

Hybrid - Remote

Salary (GBP)

31000

About the Role

The job functions will entail, but not be limited to:
• Collaborate with product management and engineering to define and implement innovative solutions for the product direction, visuals and experience.
• Execute all visual design stages from concept to final hand-off to engineering.
• Conduct user research and evaluate user feedback.
• Establish and promote design guidelines, best practices and standards.
• Attend and may lead meetings, design reviews, working groups and briefings.
• Perform other related duties in line with task assignments.
• Ability to present designs and solutions to various team members and stakeholders.
• Ability to solve problems creatively and effectively.

Requirements

What we are looking for?

The successful candidate will collaborate with team members and stake holders from multiple groups and organizations, will design application UIs fitting user needs, and will translate high-level requirements into interaction flows and artifacts to transform them into intuitive and functional user interfaces.

