 The System Engineer is responsible for the top-level specification of Sofant phased arrays. This will involve system simulation, algorithm development and specification writing.

Responsibilities
The core responsibilities include:
• Create detailed system requirements based on customer requirements

• Ensure requirements meet all relevant regulatory requirements

• Define RF system board layout floorplan and layout strategies

• Lead RF system integration and debug activity at board level

• Develop algorithms for control of RF blocks

• Collaborate with Digital hardware and software team to integrate and validate algorithms

• Develop test and calibration strategies for sub-assemblies of complete array

